{
  "duration": 69.36,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.119,
      "end": 0.28,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.639,
      "end": 1.48,
      "text": "welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.019,
      "end": 3.679,
      "text": "It's time to solve one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.38,
      "end": 5.219,
      "text": "Now in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.759,
      "end": 7.639,
      "text": "we are given an acute angle."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.3,
      "end": 9.0,
      "text": "For this angle,"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.46,
      "end": 11.079,
      "text": "the opposite side is eight"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.519,
      "end": 13.739,
      "text": "and the hypotenuse is 17."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.259,
      "end": 16.1,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find its tan."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.719,
      "end": 17.419,
      "text": "For tan theta,"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.959,
      "end": 19.599,
      "text": "we need opposite by adjacent."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.139,
      "end": 23.079,
      "text": "Opposite is already given, but adjacent is not given."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.659,
      "end": 24.279,
      "text": "So first,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.639,
      "end": 26.319,
      "text": "we have to find the adjacent side."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.859,
      "end": 28.219,
      "text": "Let the adjacent side be"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.559,
      "end": 28.68,
      "text": "X."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.219,
      "end": 35.179,
      "text": "Using Pythagoras theorem, hypotenuse square is equal to opposite square plus adjacent square."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.719,
      "end": 40.099,
      "text": "So 17 square is equal to eight square plus X square."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.52,
      "end": 41.02,
      "text": "That means"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.68,
      "end": 42.639,
      "text": "289 is equal to"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.959,
      "end": 44.299,
      "text": "64 plus X square."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.84,
      "end": 45.5,
      "text": "So X square"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.02,
      "end": 47.619,
      "text": "is equal to 289 minus"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.939,
      "end": 48.359,
      "text": "64."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.819,
      "end": 49.799,
      "text": "After subtracting,"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.399,
      "end": 56.379,
      "text": "X square is equal to 225, so X is equal to 15. Now we can find tan theta."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.899,
      "end": 59.119,
      "text": "Tan theta is equal to opposite by adjacent."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.599,
      "end": 61.939,
      "text": "So tan theta is equal to eight by 15."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.759,
      "end": 63.239,
      "text": "Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.819,
      "end": 67.0,
      "text": "the tan of the angle is eight by 15."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.799,
      "end": 69.36,
      "text": "So the correct option is option B."
    }
  ],
